BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
CATEGORIES:Academic/Educational
DESCRIPTION:Interviews are 30-45 minutes\, centered around three topics of
  your choice\, and the only criteria for becoming a Probationary Member.\
 nInterviews are not scheduled in advance. Please come to Jefferson Hall w
 hen convenient and you will be assigned the next available panel of Regul
 ar Members. Interviews will be conducted at the following times:\n\nMonda
 y\, August 31st: 10AM-7PM\nTuesday\, September 1st: 10AM-7PM\nWednesday\,
  September 2nd: 10AM-6PM\nThursday\, September 3rd: 10AM-6PM\nFriday\, Se
 ptember 4th: 10AM-6PM\n\nWhile you are welcome to come interview whenever
  you would like throughout the week\, do note that it gets busier as the 
 week progresses meaning there will be longer wait times and an increased 
 likelihood that we will not be able to guarantee you an interview. We hav
 e had to turn people away in the late afternoon on Friday. It is best to 
 interview earlier in the week (Monday and Tuesday) to secure an interview
  spot and ensure minimized wait times. If you are unable to make the abov
 e listed times for any reason at all\, please reach out immediately to me
 mbership.chair@jeffersonsociety.org to schedule an interview at a time th
 at works best for you.\nThe interviewee may choose any three topics for t
 he interview. There is no set of topics the Society likes to see\, and we
  highly discourage interviewees from trying to pick topics that way. The 
 Society looks for the ability to effectively articulate and defend positi
 ons\, for deep knowledge\, and for intellectual curiosity. Current member
 s have successfully discussed politics\, economics\, superheroes\, sports
 \, pop culture\, and literature\, among many other topics\, in their inte
 rviews. Pick topics you are passionate about and knowledgeable on.\nFor m
 ore information regarding our interview process\, please visit jeffersons
 ociety.org\n\nHosted by: The Jefferson Literary & Debating Society\n\nAdd
 itional Information can be found at: https://hoosinvolved.virginia.edu/ev
 ent/12679563
DTEND:20260902T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260902T123417Z
DTSTART:20260902T140000Z
LOCATION:Jefferson Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jefferson Society Interview Week!
UID:https://hoosinvolved.virginia.edu/event/12679563
URL:https://hoosinvolved.virginia.edu/event/12679563
X-HOSTS:The Jefferson Literary & Debating Society
END:VEVENT
