DESCRIPTION:This is your chance to connect with fellow students from diver
 se faith backgrounds and engage in meaningful conversations while enjoyin
 g free tacos from Torchy's!  \n \nThis social is based around the idea of
  "building" the semester you want\, and there will be FREE Legos for you 
 to make and take home with you to decorate your dorm or apartment!\n \nCo
 me for the community\, stay for the connections\, and leave with a deeper
  appreciation for the rich spiritual diversity on grounds. Everyone is we
 lcome\, and we would love to see a broad representation of the religious 
 and spiritual groups on grounds!\n\nHosted by: Multicultural Student Serv
 ices\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://hoosinvolved.virg
 inia.edu/event/12670166
