DESCRIPTION:\nWhat makes a place beautiful\, sustainable\, and beloved? Jo
 in internationally acclaimed architectural and interior designer Ben Pent
 reath as he explores how classical and vernacular architecture and urbani
 sm continue to shape meaningful places for contemporary life\, showing th
 at these traditions remain vibrant\, relevant\, and alive today. Presente
 d by the Classical Architecture Society at the University of Virginia\, a
  community of students interested in classical and vernacular architectur
 e and urbanism\nThis event is free and open to all\; registration is requ
 ested. RSVP Here\n\nHosted by: Classical Architecture Society at UVA\n\nA
 dditional Information can be found at: https://hoosinvolved.virginia.edu/
 event/12594396
