DESCRIPTION:Are you a first-year student considering a career in clinical 
 healthcare—such as medicine (MD/DO)\, physician assistant (PA)\, or anoth
 er patient-focused field? Join us for the Pre-Health Class of 2030 Meetin
 g\, your essential first step toward building a strong and competitive pr
 e-health foundation.\nThis session will cover everything you need to succ
 eed as a first-year pre-health student\, including:\n\nAcademic pre-requi
 sites and course planning\nClinical and experiential learning opportuniti
 es\nStrategies for gaining meaningful healthcare experience\nTips for dev
 eloping a competitive application from day one\n\nAttending this meeting 
 will also give you access to schedule one-on-one advising appointments wi
 th pre-health advisors for personalized support throughout your journey.\
 nStart strong—your path to a healthcare career begins here! Register toda
 y via Handshake!\nAll students pre-health students are expected to attend
  one of these sessions. Please note that this event is one of two session
 s occurring between Tuesday\, September 8th and Wednesday\, September 9th
 . Please plan to attend either Session 1 on Tuesday at 6:00pm or Session 
 2 on Wednesday at 6:00pm.\nRegister for Session 1\nRegister for Session 2
 \n\nHosted by: Pre-Health Advising\n\nAdditional Information can be found
  at: https://hoosinvolved.virginia.edu/event/12621279
