DESCRIPTION:The application for the 2026-2027 requires that all applicants
  have been trained last year or this year. Due to changes in the funding 
 process\, attending again this year is recommended for those who trained 
 last year.\nGrants training is required\, free\, and offered via zoom\, a
 nd in-person at Newcomb Hall across August and September. \nThis training
  is required for student leaders. If you are a professor or a department\
 , training is not required\, but you are welcome to attend. If your organ
 ization is registered as a CIO\, SSO\, or is part of an academic program 
 (e.g. Cavalier Marching Band\, SEAS Experiential Learning teams\, Third Y
 ear Class Council)\, a student must attend the training and apply for the
  grant on behalf of your organization.  \nCLICK HERE to register for trai
 ning\nThe grants portal is located here: https://www.grantinterface.com/H
 ome/Logon?urlkey=uvapp and opens on August 1.\n\nHosted by: UVA Parents P
 rogram\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://hoosinvolved.vi
 rginia.edu/event/12539747
